Package: fastsemR
Title: R Interface to the fastsem SEM Estimator
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Luis", "Araujo", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "lf.araujo@pm.me",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7987-8765"))
Description: Provides R bindings to the fastsem structural equation modelling
    engine, a compiled Nim library that supports ML, DWLS, and FIML estimators
    with optional GPU acceleration. Models specified in umx/OpenMx (RAM) or
    lavaan are fitted by fastsem and returned as the same kind of object, so
    the OpenMx, umx and lavaan summary and comparison tools continue to work.
    Multi-group models with shared and group-specific parameters, definition
    variables, equality constraints and cluster-robust standard errors are
    supported. The compiled binary is downloaded automatically from
    GitHub Releases on first use.
